{{- /*
Note: Subtle formatting issues will cause kubectl edit (and by extension also the edit feature in tools like k9s) to
become unusable, see the note at the top of daemonset.config.yaml.template for details. In short: for text/template
pipelines that might result in no output, either start the pipeline with "{{-" or start it at the beginning of the
line without leading space characters.
*/}}

{{- /* This is the configuration of the Signal Control collector, a deployment that receives the Dash0-bound telemetry
of the daemonset collector and the cluster-metrics deployment collector via OTLP, applies Signal Control (SC) and
exports to Dash0. It is the only collector workload that runs SC components and, whenever it exists, the only one that
exports to Dash0; the two producer collectors keep only their non-SC components and export passthrough (non-Dash0)
telemetry themselves. In SCE-only mode, no producer collectors are deployed and applications send their telemetry here
directly.

All enrichment that depends on the sending node or pod (resource_detection, k8s_attributes,
transform/cluster_and_operator_attributes, the custom filters and transforms from spec.filter and spec.transform of the
Dash0Monitoring resources) is applied upstream (in SCE-only mode, not at all) and must NOT be repeated here:
k8s_attributes' "from: connection" pod association would resolve every record to the sending collector's pod, and the
resource_detection k8s_api/eks detectors would report this collector's node. The transformation rules configured in
Dash0 are a Signal Control capability and are applied here, by dash0transform. Batching happens in the exporters
(sending_queue::batch), both here and in the producers.

The producers route on k8s.namespace.name, keep the passthrough copies locally and forward one copy of the Dash0-bound
telemetry here. This collector applies the same k8s.namespace.name routing again to pick the (namespace, dataset)
branch, so the resulting fan-out is identical to applying Signal Control upstream. Passthrough exporters therefore
never appear in any pipeline here. Variables:
- $scDefault: the default path has at least one Dash0 exporter, so the default SC branch exists.
- $hasNamespacedDash0: at least one namespace has a Dash0 exporter, hence per-namespace SC branches exist.
- $useRouting: routing is used (only with namespaced Dash0 exporters; the routing connector requires a non-empty
  table). Without it, everything received here belongs to the default branch.
- $samplingActive: tail sampling is enabled and something feeds it.

Metering: the mark a dash0metering processor stamps is what settles Signal Control usage for billing. Once Dash0 turns
enforcement on for an organization it is also what every Signal Control component requires before it acts.

Processor order: every SC branch runs the Signal Control processors in the order Dash0 runs them: metering, the ingress
filter, redaction, transform, dash0resource, then signal-to-metrics; RED metrics, operation naming, log enrichment and the
egress filter follow in a post-filter pipeline. The one intended difference is the position of dash0resource: Dash0 runs
it after the metric-deriving connectors, here it runs before them, because it stamps dash0.edge.origin and the connectors
copy the resource of the telemetry they derive metrics from; without the marker Dash0 does not treat these metrics as
processed on the edge. Running after transform, dash0resource also hashes the transformed resource.

Filter stages: with the spam filter enabled, every SC branch runs dash0filter twice, as Dash0 does: with the ingress role
before the components that derive metrics from the telemetry, and with the egress role after them. The ingress stage
only applies positive filters (apply_positive_filters_only), so rules with a negative match or one on what log enrichment
adds only take effect in the egress stage. Filters that only apply after the metrics are derived (postFilterOnly), such
as the drop filters of signal-to-metrics rules with dropMatched, are skipped in the ingress stage as well. Metrics derive
nothing, so their two stages run in one pipeline. signal_control_modes reports the two stages as pre-filter and
post-filter.
*/}}
{{- $scDefault := gt (len .Exporters.DefaultDash0Exporters) 0 -}}
{{- $hasNamespacedDash0 := .Exporters.HasNamespacedDash0Exporters -}}
{{- $useRouting := $hasNamespacedDash0 -}}
{{- $samplingActive := and .SignalControl.SamplingEnabled (or $scDefault $hasNamespacedDash0) -}}

extensions:
  health_check:
    endpoint: "{{ .SelfIpReference }}:13133"
  {{- if .EnableProfExtension }}
  pprof: {}
  {{- end }}
  dash0settingsonedgeextension:
{{- if .SignalControl.SpamFilterEnabled }}
    {{- /* Builds the drop filters for signal-to-metrics rules with dropMatched, which only the egress dash0filter
    instances apply. Without the spam filter there is no egress stage, and the setting has no effect. */}}
    drop_matched_logs: true
{{- end }}
{{- if and .SignalControl.EdgeProxyEnabled .SignalControl.ApiEndpoint }}
    {{- /* Edge Proxy mode: subscribe to the in-cluster Edge Proxy, which performs a single settings poll per site
    and fans the snapshot out to every collector. The Endpoint/auth_token HTTP fields are ignored in this mode. */}}
    proxy:
      address: {{ .SignalControl.Endpoint }}
      insecure: {{ .SignalControl.Insecure }}
{{- else }}
    {{- /* Direct mode: poll the region-bound Dash0 API directly (one poll per collector replica). Also the fail-loud
    fallback when the Edge Proxy is enabled but no API endpoint is known: the proxy then serves no settings feed, so
    subscribing to it would loop silently, whereas an empty endpoint here is rejected by the extension at startup. */}}
    endpoint: {{ .SignalControl.ApiEndpoint }}
    auth_token: ${env:DASH0_SIGNAL_CONTROL_AUTH_TOKEN}
{{- if .SignalControl.LogEnrichmentEnabled }}
    {{- /* Direct mode only: in Edge Proxy mode patterns ride the settings gRPC stream and this block is
    ignored, so the Edge Proxy's UPSTREAM_EDGESETTINGS_LOGPATTERNS_ENABLED gates polling there instead. */}}
    log_patterns:
      enabled: true
{{- if .SignalControl.LogPatternRefreshInterval }}
      refresh_interval: {{ .SignalControl.LogPatternRefreshInterval }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- if $scDefault }}
  dash0metricrecorder: {}
{{- end }}
{{- if $hasNamespacedDash0 }}
{{- range $ns, $sc := .Exporters.NamespaceSC }}
{{- range $b := $sc.DatasetBranches }}
  dash0metricrecorder/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}: {}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}

connectors:
{{- if $scDefault }}
  forward/traces-default-exporter: {}
  forward/metrics-default-exporter: {}
  forward/logs-default-exporter: {}
  forward/traces-post-filter: {}
  forward/logs-post-filter: {}
{{- end }}
{{- if $hasNamespacedDash0 }}
{{- range $ns, $sc := .Exporters.NamespaceSC }}
{{- range $b := $sc.DatasetBranches }}
  forward/traces-post-filter/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}: {}
  forward/logs-post-filter/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}: {}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- if not $useRouting }}
  forward/traces-to-sc: {}
  forward/metrics-to-sc: {}
  forward/logs-to-sc: {}
{{- end }}
{{- if $samplingActive }}
  forward/traces-to-sampling: {}
{{- end }}
{{- if $scDefault }}
{{- if or .SignalControl.RedMetricsMaxTimeSeries .SignalControl.RedMetricsAdditionalSpanAttributes }}
  dash0redmetrics:
{{- if .SignalControl.RedMetricsMaxTimeSeries }}
    max_time_series: {{ .SignalControl.RedMetricsMaxTimeSeries }}
{{- end }}
{{- if .SignalControl.RedMetricsAdditionalSpanAttributes }}
    additional_span_attributes:
    {{- range $attr := .SignalControl.RedMetricsAdditionalSpanAttributes }}
    - '{{ $attr }}'
    {{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- else }}
  dash0redmetrics: {}
{{- end }}
{{- if .SignalControl.SignalToMetricsEnabled }}
  dash0signaltometrics:
    metric_recorder: dash0metricrecorder
{{- if .SignalControl.SignalToMetricsMaxTimeSeries }}
    max_time_series: {{ .SignalControl.SignalToMetricsMaxTimeSeries }}
{{- end }}
{{- if .SignalControl.SignalToMetricsCacheExpiration }}
    cache_expiration: {{ .SignalControl.SignalToMetricsCacheExpiration }}
{{- end }}
{{- if .SignalControl.SignalToMetricsFlushInterval }}
    metrics_flush_interval: {{ .SignalControl.SignalToMetricsFlushInterval }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- if $hasNamespacedDash0 }}
{{- range $ns, $sc := .Exporters.NamespaceSC }}
{{- range $b := $sc.DatasetBranches }}
{{- if or $.SignalControl.RedMetricsMaxTimeSeries $.SignalControl.RedMetricsAdditionalSpanAttributes }}
  dash0redmetrics/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}:
{{- if $.SignalControl.RedMetricsMaxTimeSeries }}
    max_time_series: {{ $.SignalControl.RedMetricsMaxTimeSeries }}
{{- end }}
{{- if $.SignalControl.RedMetricsAdditionalSpanAttributes }}
    additional_span_attributes:
    {{- range $attr := $.SignalControl.RedMetricsAdditionalSpanAttributes }}
    - '{{ $attr }}'
    {{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- else }}
  dash0redmetrics/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}: {}
{{- end }}
{{- if $.SignalControl.SignalToMetricsEnabled }}
  dash0signaltometrics/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}:
    metric_recorder: dash0metricrecorder/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
{{- if $.SignalControl.SignalToMetricsMaxTimeSeries }}
    max_time_series: {{ $.SignalControl.SignalToMetricsMaxTimeSeries }}
{{- end }}
{{- if $.SignalControl.SignalToMetricsCacheExpiration }}
    cache_expiration: {{ $.SignalControl.SignalToMetricsCacheExpiration }}
{{- end }}
{{- if $.SignalControl.SignalToMetricsFlushInterval }}
    metrics_flush_interval: {{ $.SignalControl.SignalToMetricsFlushInterval }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}

  {{- if $useRouting }}
  routing/traces:
{{- if $scDefault }}
    default_pipelines: [traces/sc/default]
{{- end }}
    error_mode: ignore
    table:
    {{- range $ns, $sc := $.Exporters.NamespaceSC }}
    {{- if $sc.DatasetBranches }}
      - context: resource
        condition: attributes["k8s.namespace.name"] == "{{ $ns }}"
        pipelines:
        {{- range $b := $sc.DatasetBranches }}
          - traces/sc/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
        {{- end }}
    {{- end }}
    {{- end }}
{{- if $samplingActive }}
  routing/traces-sampled:
{{- if $scDefault }}
    default_pipelines: [traces/export/default]
{{- end }}
    error_mode: ignore
    table:
    {{- range $ns, $sc := $.Exporters.NamespaceSC }}
    {{- if $sc.DatasetBranches }}
      - context: resource
        condition: attributes["k8s.namespace.name"] == "{{ $ns }}"
        pipelines:
          - traces/export/sampled/ns/{{ $ns }}
    {{- end }}
    {{- end }}
{{- end }}
  routing/metrics:
{{- if $scDefault }}
    default_pipelines: [metrics/sc/default]
{{- end }}
    error_mode: ignore
    table:
    {{- range $ns, $sc := $.Exporters.NamespaceSC }}
    {{- if $sc.DatasetBranches }}
      - context: resource
        condition: attributes["k8s.namespace.name"] == "{{ $ns }}"
        pipelines:
        {{- range $b := $sc.DatasetBranches }}
          - metrics/sc/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
        {{- end }}
    {{- end }}
    {{- end }}
  routing/logs:
{{- if $scDefault }}
    default_pipelines: [logs/sc/default]
{{- end }}
    error_mode: ignore
    table:
    {{- range $ns, $sc := $.Exporters.NamespaceSC }}
    {{- if $sc.DatasetBranches }}
      - context: resource
        condition: attributes["k8s.namespace.name"] == "{{ $ns }}"
        pipelines:
        {{- range $b := $sc.DatasetBranches }}
          - logs/sc/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
        {{- end }}
    {{- end }}
    {{- end }}
  {{- end }}

receivers:
  otlp:
    protocols:
      grpc:
        endpoint: "{{ .SelfIpReference }}:4317"
        {{- /*
        The producers' OTLP exporter batches by item count, not by byte size, so batches can exceed grpc-go's 4 MiB
        default. The limit is the same one the producers' own OTLP receivers use.
        */}}
        max_recv_msg_size_mib: 8388608
        {{- /*
        The producers reach this collector through the service's virtual IP, where kube-proxy picks a backend once per
        connection. Their gRPC connections would otherwise live forever and pin each producer to one pod, so the
        connections are aged out to let senders redistribute (and to pick up newly added pods).
        */}}
        keepalive:
          server_parameters:
            max_connection_age: 5m
            max_connection_age_grace: 30s
      http:
        endpoint: "{{ .SelfIpReference }}:4318"
{{- if $scDefault }}
  dash0metricrecorder:
    metric_recorder: dash0metricrecorder
{{- end }}
{{- if $hasNamespacedDash0 }}
{{- range $ns, $sc := .Exporters.NamespaceSC }}
{{- range $b := $sc.DatasetBranches }}
  dash0metricrecorder/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}:
    metric_recorder: dash0metricrecorder/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}

processors:
  memory_limiter:
    check_interval: 1s
    {{- if .MemoryLimiterLimitMiB }}
    limit_mib: {{ .MemoryLimiterLimitMiB }}
    spike_limit_mib: {{ .MemoryLimiterSpikeLimitMiB }}
    {{- else }}
    limit_percentage: 80
    spike_limit_percentage: 25
    {{- end }}

  resource/signal_control_attributes:
    attributes:
    - key: dash0.org.technical.id
      value: edge
      action: upsert
    - key: dash0.dataset
      value: {{ .SignalControl.Dataset }}
      action: upsert
{{- if $hasNamespacedDash0 }}
{{- range $ns, $sc := .Exporters.NamespaceSC }}
{{- range $b := $sc.DatasetBranches }}
  resource/signal_control_attributes/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}:
    attributes:
    - key: dash0.org.technical.id
      value: edge
      action: upsert
    - key: dash0.dataset
      value: {{ $b.Dataset }}
      action: upsert
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
  dash0resource: {}
{{- if $scDefault }}
  dash0metering:
    mode: count_and_mark
    metric_recorder: dash0metricrecorder
  {{- /* The post-filter pipelines are fed by the SC pipelines, so their telemetry arrives already counted. */}}
  dash0metering/post-filter:
    mode: mark_only
    metric_recorder: dash0metricrecorder
{{- end }}
{{- if $samplingActive }}
  {{- /* The sampled pipeline is fed by the SC pipelines, so its spans arrive already marked and counting them
  again would double the bill. The instance exists so that dash0sampling is behind a metering processor. It keeps a
  metric_recorder even though it records no volume: that is what lets it report the
  dash0.metering.signal_control.evaluations liveness metric, the only signal that says this pipeline is metered. */}}
  dash0metering/sampling:
    mode: mark_only
{{- if $scDefault }}
    {{- /* Only the default recorder can serve this instance: traces/sampled is shared by all branches, so no
    per-branch recorder fits it. Without a default Dash0 export there is none, and mark_only needs none. */}}
    metric_recorder: dash0metricrecorder
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- if $hasNamespacedDash0 }}
{{- range $ns, $sc := .Exporters.NamespaceSC }}
{{- range $b := $sc.DatasetBranches }}
  dash0metering/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}:
{{- if eq $b.DatasetIndex 0 }}
    mode: count_and_mark
{{- else }}
    {{- /* A clone of what branch 0 already counted, so this branch only marks. Its usage is therefore attributed to
    the dataset of branch 0. It keeps a metric_recorder to report dash0.metering.signal_control.evaluations, which is
    what distinguishes "metered, deliberately not counting" from "not metered" on this branch. */}}
    mode: mark_only
{{- end }}
    metric_recorder: dash0metricrecorder/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
  dash0metering/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}/post-filter:
    mode: mark_only
    metric_recorder: dash0metricrecorder/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- if or .SignalControl.OperationPreferSpanName .SignalControl.OperationCardinalityRules }}
  dash0operation:
{{- if .SignalControl.OperationPreferSpanName }}
    prefer_span_name: true
{{- end }}
{{- if .SignalControl.OperationCardinalityRules }}
    cardinality_rules:
    {{- range $rule := .SignalControl.OperationCardinalityRules }}
    - id: '{{ $rule.Id }}'
{{- if $rule.SourceAttribute }}
      source_attribute: '{{ $rule.SourceAttribute }}'
{{- end }}
{{- if $rule.QuickFilter }}
      quick_filter: '{{ $rule.QuickFilter }}'
{{- end }}
      operation_matchers:
      {{- range $m := $rule.OperationMatchers }}
      - regex: '{{ $m.Regex }}'
        replacements:
        {{- range $r := $m.Replacements }}
        - '{{ $r }}'
        {{- end }}
{{- if $m.QuickFilter }}
        quick_filter: '{{ $m.QuickFilter }}'
{{- end }}
{{- if $m.Literal }}
        literal: true
{{- end }}
      {{- end }}
    {{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- else }}
  dash0operation: {}
{{- end }}
{{- if .SignalControl.LogEnrichmentEnabled }}
  {{- /* Edge mode is auto-detected from the dash0settingsonedge extension; there is no mode key. The parser
  must precede grouping in the logs pipeline, since grouping matches on the dash0.log.message it writes. */}}
  dash0logparser:
    enable:
      default: true
{{- if .SignalControl.LogParserCacheExpiration }}
    edge_cache_expiration: {{ .SignalControl.LogParserCacheExpiration }}
{{- end }}
  dash0loggrouping:
    enable:
      default: true
{{- if .SignalControl.LogGroupingCacheExpiration }}
    cache_expiration: {{ .SignalControl.LogGroupingCacheExpiration }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- if and $scDefault .SignalControl.SpamFilterEnabled }}
  dash0filter/ingress:
    signal_control_role: ingress
    signal_control_modes: true
    apply_positive_filters_only: true
    metric_recorder: dash0metricrecorder
{{- if .SignalControl.SpamFilterCacheExpiration }}
    cache_expiration: {{ .SignalControl.SpamFilterCacheExpiration }}
{{- end }}
{{- if .SignalControl.SpamFilterAllowNoSettingsExt }}
    allow_no_settings_ext: {{ .SignalControl.SpamFilterAllowNoSettingsExt }}
{{- end }}
  dash0filter/egress:
    signal_control_role: egress
    signal_control_modes: true
    metric_recorder: dash0metricrecorder
{{- if .SignalControl.SpamFilterCacheExpiration }}
    cache_expiration: {{ .SignalControl.SpamFilterCacheExpiration }}
{{- end }}
{{- if .SignalControl.SpamFilterAllowNoSettingsExt }}
    allow_no_settings_ext: {{ .SignalControl.SpamFilterAllowNoSettingsExt }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- if and $hasNamespacedDash0 .SignalControl.SpamFilterEnabled }}
{{- range $ns, $sc := .Exporters.NamespaceSC }}
{{- range $b := $sc.DatasetBranches }}
  dash0filter/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}/ingress:
    signal_control_role: ingress
    signal_control_modes: true
    apply_positive_filters_only: true
    metric_recorder: dash0metricrecorder/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
{{- if $.SignalControl.SpamFilterCacheExpiration }}
    cache_expiration: {{ $.SignalControl.SpamFilterCacheExpiration }}
{{- end }}
{{- if $.SignalControl.SpamFilterAllowNoSettingsExt }}
    allow_no_settings_ext: {{ $.SignalControl.SpamFilterAllowNoSettingsExt }}
{{- end }}
  dash0filter/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}/egress:
    signal_control_role: egress
    signal_control_modes: true
    metric_recorder: dash0metricrecorder/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
{{- if $.SignalControl.SpamFilterCacheExpiration }}
    cache_expiration: {{ $.SignalControl.SpamFilterCacheExpiration }}
{{- end }}
{{- if $.SignalControl.SpamFilterAllowNoSettingsExt }}
    allow_no_settings_ext: {{ $.SignalControl.SpamFilterAllowNoSettingsExt }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- if .SignalControl.TransformEnabled }}
{{- /* dash0transform applies the transformation rules of the dataset in dash0.dataset, which
resource/signal_control_attributes sets per branch; default_dataset is the fallback when it is missing. It marks each
resource it ran the rules on, so Dash0 does not run them again. Like every Signal Control component, it only acts on
resources a dash0metering processor marked, so metering runs before it in every pipeline. */}}
{{- if $scDefault }}
  dash0transform:
    enable:
      default: true
    metric_recorder: dash0metricrecorder
    default_dataset: {{ .SignalControl.Dataset }}
{{- end }}
{{- if $hasNamespacedDash0 }}
{{- range $ns, $sc := .Exporters.NamespaceSC }}
{{- range $b := $sc.DatasetBranches }}
  dash0transform/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}:
    enable:
      default: true
    metric_recorder: dash0metricrecorder/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
    default_dataset: {{ $b.Dataset }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- if .SignalControl.CardholderDataRedactionEnabled }}
{{- /* On edge, dash0redaction redacts everything it receives, so adding it to a pipeline is the switch. It marks each
resource as redacted, which makes Dash0 skip its own redaction for it. It runs right after the ingress filter, where
Dash0 runs it, so every later processor and connector works on redacted telemetry. */}}
{{- if $scDefault }}
  dash0redaction:
    metric_recorder: dash0metricrecorder
{{- end }}
{{- if $hasNamespacedDash0 }}
{{- range $ns, $sc := .Exporters.NamespaceSC }}
{{- range $b := $sc.DatasetBranches }}
  dash0redaction/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}:
    metric_recorder: dash0metricrecorder/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- if $samplingActive }}
  dash0sampling:
{{- if $scDefault }}
    metric_recorder: dash0metricrecorder
{{- end }}
    decision_maker_endpoint: {{ .SignalControl.Endpoint }}
    decision_maker_headers:
      Authorization: Bearer ${env:DASH0_SIGNAL_CONTROL_AUTH_TOKEN}
      Dash0-Dataset: {{ .SignalControl.Dataset }}
    decision_maker_insecure: {{ .SignalControl.Insecure }}
    default_dataset: {{ .SignalControl.Dataset }}
{{- if .SignalControl.SamplingFallbackSampleRatio }}
    fallback_sample_ratio: {{ .SignalControl.SamplingFallbackSampleRatio }}
{{- end }}
{{- if .SignalControl.SamplingDebug }}
    debug: true
{{- end }}
{{- if .SignalControl.SamplingEnableBatching }}
    enable_batching: true
{{- end }}
    reservoir:
      type: {{ .SignalControl.SamplingReservoirType }}
      metric_level: {{ .SignalControl.SamplingReservoirMetricLevel }}
{{- if .SignalControl.SamplingReservoirBufferDuration }}
      buffer_duration: {{ .SignalControl.SamplingReservoirBufferDuration }}
{{- end }}
{{- if eq .SignalControl.SamplingReservoirType "disk" }}
      data_dir: /var/lib/dash0/trace-reservoir
      max_disk_bytes: {{ .SignalControl.SamplingReservoirMaxDiskBytes }}
{{- else if .SignalControl.SamplingReservoirMaxMemoryBytes }}
      max_memory_bytes: {{ .SignalControl.SamplingReservoirMaxMemoryBytes }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}

{{ template "exporters" . }}

service:
  extensions:
  - health_check
  {{- if .EnableProfExtension }}
  - pprof
  {{- end }}
  - dash0settingsonedgeextension
  {{- if $scDefault }}
  - dash0metricrecorder
  {{- end }}
  {{- if $hasNamespacedDash0 }}
  {{- range $ns, $sc := .Exporters.NamespaceSC }}
  {{- range $b := $sc.DatasetBranches }}
  - dash0metricrecorder/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
  {{- end }}
  {{- end }}
  {{- end }}

  pipelines:
    traces/otlp-to-sc:
      receivers:
        - otlp
      processors:
        - memory_limiter
      exporters:
        {{- if $useRouting }}
        - routing/traces
        {{- else }}
        - forward/traces-to-sc
        {{- end }}

{{- if $scDefault }}

    traces/sc/default:
      receivers:
        {{- if $useRouting }}
        - routing/traces
        {{- else }}
        - forward/traces-to-sc
        {{- end }}
      processors:
        - resource/signal_control_attributes
        - dash0metering
        {{- if .SignalControl.SpamFilterEnabled }}
        - dash0filter/ingress
        {{- end }}
        {{- if .SignalControl.CardholderDataRedactionEnabled }}
        - dash0redaction
        {{- end }}
        {{- if .SignalControl.TransformEnabled }}
        - dash0transform
        {{- end }}
        - dash0resource
      exporters:
        - forward/traces-post-filter
        {{- if .SignalControl.SignalToMetricsEnabled }}
        - dash0signaltometrics
        {{- end }}

    traces/post-filter/default:
      receivers:
        - forward/traces-post-filter
      processors:
        - dash0metering/post-filter
        - dash0operation
        {{- if .SignalControl.SpamFilterEnabled }}
        - dash0filter/egress
        {{- end }}
      exporters:
        - dash0redmetrics
        {{- if $samplingActive }}
        - forward/traces-to-sampling
        {{- else }}
        - forward/traces-default-exporter
        {{- end }}

    metrics/derived/default:
      receivers:
        - dash0redmetrics
        {{- if .SignalControl.SignalToMetricsEnabled }}
        - dash0signaltometrics
        {{- end }}
      exporters:
      {{- if (or .DevelopmentMode .DebugVerbosityDetailed) }}
        - debug
      {{- end }}
      {{- range $i, $exporter := .Exporters.DefaultDash0Exporters }}
        - {{ $exporter.Name }}
      {{- end }}
{{- end }}

{{- if $samplingActive }}

    traces/sampled:
      receivers:
        - forward/traces-to-sampling
      processors:
        - dash0metering/sampling
        - dash0sampling
      exporters:
        {{- if $hasNamespacedDash0 }}
        - routing/traces-sampled
        {{- else }}
        - forward/traces-default-exporter
        {{- end }}
{{- end }}

{{- if $scDefault }}

    traces/export/default:
      receivers:
        {{- if and $samplingActive $hasNamespacedDash0 }}
        - routing/traces-sampled
        {{- end }}
        {{- if or (not $samplingActive) (not $hasNamespacedDash0) }}
        - forward/traces-default-exporter
        {{- end }}
      exporters:
      {{- if (or .DevelopmentMode .DebugVerbosityDetailed) }}
        - debug
      {{- end }}
      {{- range $i, $exporter := .Exporters.DefaultDash0Exporters }}
        - {{ $exporter.Name }}
      {{- end }}
{{- end }}

{{- range $ns, $sc := $.Exporters.NamespaceSC }}
{{- range $b := $sc.DatasetBranches }}

    traces/sc/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}:
      receivers:
        - routing/traces
      processors:
        - resource/signal_control_attributes/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
        - dash0metering/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
        {{- if $.SignalControl.SpamFilterEnabled }}
        - dash0filter/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}/ingress
        {{- end }}
        {{- if $.SignalControl.CardholderDataRedactionEnabled }}
        - dash0redaction/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
        {{- end }}
        {{- if $.SignalControl.TransformEnabled }}
        - dash0transform/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
        {{- end }}
        - dash0resource
      exporters:
        - forward/traces-post-filter/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
        {{- if $.SignalControl.SignalToMetricsEnabled }}
        - dash0signaltometrics/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
        {{- end }}

    traces/post-filter/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}:
      receivers:
        - forward/traces-post-filter/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
      processors:
        - dash0metering/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}/post-filter
        - dash0operation
        {{- if $.SignalControl.SpamFilterEnabled }}
        - dash0filter/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}/egress
        {{- end }}
      exporters:
      {{- if (or $.DevelopmentMode $.DebugVerbosityDetailed) }}
        - debug
      {{- end }}
        - dash0redmetrics/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
        {{- if and $samplingActive (eq $b.DatasetIndex 0) }}
        - forward/traces-to-sampling
        {{- else }}
        {{- range $exporter := $b.Exporters }}
        - {{ $exporter.Name }}
        {{- end }}
        {{- end }}

    metrics/derived/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}:
      receivers:
        - dash0redmetrics/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
        {{- if $.SignalControl.SignalToMetricsEnabled }}
        - dash0signaltometrics/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
        {{- end }}
      exporters:
      {{- if (or $.DevelopmentMode $.DebugVerbosityDetailed) }}
        - debug
      {{- end }}
        {{- range $exporter := $b.Exporters }}
        - {{ $exporter.Name }}
        {{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- if and $samplingActive $sc.DatasetBranches }}

    traces/export/sampled/ns/{{ $ns }}:
      receivers:
        - routing/traces-sampled
      exporters:
      {{- if (or $.DevelopmentMode $.DebugVerbosityDetailed) }}
        - debug
      {{- end }}
        {{- range $exporter := (index $sc.DatasetBranches 0).Exporters }}
        - {{ $exporter.Name }}
        {{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}

    metrics/otlp-to-sc:
      receivers:
        - otlp
      processors:
        - memory_limiter
      exporters:
        {{- if $useRouting }}
        - routing/metrics
        {{- else }}
        - forward/metrics-to-sc
        {{- end }}

{{- if $scDefault }}

    metrics/sc/default:
      receivers:
        {{- if $useRouting }}
        - routing/metrics
        {{- else }}
        - forward/metrics-to-sc
        {{- end }}
      processors:
        - resource/signal_control_attributes
        {{- if or .SignalControl.SpamFilterEnabled .SignalControl.TransformEnabled }}
        - dash0metering
        {{- end }}
        {{- if .SignalControl.SpamFilterEnabled }}
        - dash0filter/ingress
        {{- end }}
        {{- if .SignalControl.CardholderDataRedactionEnabled }}
        - dash0redaction
        {{- end }}
        {{- if .SignalControl.TransformEnabled }}
        - dash0transform
        {{- end }}
        {{- if or .SignalControl.SpamFilterEnabled .SignalControl.TransformEnabled }}
        {{- /* dash0resource stamps the edge-origin marker. Dash0 only recognizes metering's mark as settled usage when
        both travel together, so wherever metering runs, dash0resource runs as well. */}}
        - dash0resource
        {{- end }}
        - dash0operation
        {{- if .SignalControl.SpamFilterEnabled }}
        - dash0filter/egress
        {{- end }}
      exporters:
        - forward/metrics-default-exporter
{{- /* The Signal Control counters (metering and spam filter) get their own pipeline rather than riding
metrics/derived, which has to reach every Dash0 exporter because the derived metrics belong in every dataset the
telemetry reaches. A counter datapoint must reach Dash0 exactly once - the dataset comes from the export's
Dash0-Dataset header and the accountant sums what arrives, so a second delivery charges the same usage twice. */}}

    metrics/signal-control-counters:
      receivers:
        - dash0metricrecorder
      exporters:
        {{- if (or .DevelopmentMode .DebugVerbosityDetailed) }}
        - debug
        {{- end }}
        - {{ .Exporters.DefaultCounterExporter.Name }}

    metrics/export/default:
      receivers:
        - forward/metrics-default-exporter
      exporters:
        {{- if (or .DevelopmentMode .DebugVerbosityDetailed) }}
        - debug
        {{- end }}
        {{- range $i, $exporter := .Exporters.DefaultDash0Exporters }}
        - {{ $exporter.Name }}
        {{- end }}
{{- end }}

{{- range $ns, $sc := $.Exporters.NamespaceSC }}
{{- range $b := $sc.DatasetBranches }}

    metrics/sc/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}:
      receivers:
        - routing/metrics
      processors:
        - resource/signal_control_attributes/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
        {{- if or $.SignalControl.SpamFilterEnabled $.SignalControl.TransformEnabled }}
        - dash0metering/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
        {{- end }}
        {{- if $.SignalControl.SpamFilterEnabled }}
        - dash0filter/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}/ingress
        {{- end }}
        {{- if $.SignalControl.CardholderDataRedactionEnabled }}
        - dash0redaction/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
        {{- end }}
        {{- if $.SignalControl.TransformEnabled }}
        - dash0transform/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
        {{- end }}
        {{- if or $.SignalControl.SpamFilterEnabled $.SignalControl.TransformEnabled }}
        - dash0resource
        {{- end }}
        - dash0operation
        {{- if $.SignalControl.SpamFilterEnabled }}
        - dash0filter/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}/egress
        {{- end }}
      exporters:
        {{- if (or $.DevelopmentMode $.DebugVerbosityDetailed) }}
        - debug
        {{- end }}
        {{- range $exporter := $b.Exporters }}
        - {{ $exporter.Name }}
        {{- end }}

    metrics/signal-control-counters/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}:
      receivers:
        - dash0metricrecorder/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
      exporters:
        {{- if (or $.DevelopmentMode $.DebugVerbosityDetailed) }}
        - debug
        {{- end }}
        - {{ $b.CounterExporter.Name }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}

    logs/otlp-to-sc:
      receivers:
        - otlp
      processors:
        - memory_limiter
      exporters:
        {{- if $useRouting }}
        - routing/logs
        {{- else }}
        - forward/logs-to-sc
        {{- end }}

{{- if $scDefault }}

    logs/sc/default:
      receivers:
        {{- if $useRouting }}
        - routing/logs
        {{- else }}
        - forward/logs-to-sc
        {{- end }}
      processors:
        - resource/signal_control_attributes
        {{- if or .SignalControl.SpamFilterEnabled .SignalControl.SignalToMetricsEnabled .SignalControl.TransformEnabled }}
        - dash0metering
        {{- end }}
        {{- if .SignalControl.SpamFilterEnabled }}
        - dash0filter/ingress
        {{- end }}
        {{- if .SignalControl.CardholderDataRedactionEnabled }}
        - dash0redaction
        {{- end }}
        {{- if .SignalControl.TransformEnabled }}
        - dash0transform
        {{- end }}
        - dash0resource
      exporters:
        - forward/logs-post-filter
        {{- if .SignalControl.SignalToMetricsEnabled }}
        - dash0signaltometrics
        {{- end }}

    logs/post-filter/default:
      receivers:
        - forward/logs-post-filter
      {{- if or .SignalControl.SpamFilterEnabled .SignalControl.LogEnrichmentEnabled }}
      processors:
        {{- if .SignalControl.SpamFilterEnabled }}
        - dash0metering/post-filter
        {{- end }}
        {{- if .SignalControl.LogEnrichmentEnabled }}
        - dash0logparser
        - dash0loggrouping
        {{- end }}
        {{- if .SignalControl.SpamFilterEnabled }}
        - dash0filter/egress
        {{- end }}
      {{- end }}
      exporters:
        - forward/logs-default-exporter

    logs/export/default:
      receivers:
        - forward/logs-default-exporter
      exporters:
        {{- if (or .DevelopmentMode .DebugVerbosityDetailed) }}
        - debug
        {{- end }}
        {{- range $i, $exporter := .Exporters.DefaultDash0Exporters }}
        - {{ $exporter.Name }}
        {{- end }}
{{- end }}

{{- range $ns, $sc := $.Exporters.NamespaceSC }}
{{- range $b := $sc.DatasetBranches }}

    logs/sc/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}:
      receivers:
        - routing/logs
      processors:
        - resource/signal_control_attributes/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
        {{- if or $.SignalControl.SpamFilterEnabled $.SignalControl.SignalToMetricsEnabled $.SignalControl.TransformEnabled }}
        - dash0metering/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
        {{- end }}
        {{- if $.SignalControl.SpamFilterEnabled }}
        - dash0filter/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}/ingress
        {{- end }}
        {{- if $.SignalControl.CardholderDataRedactionEnabled }}
        - dash0redaction/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
        {{- end }}
        {{- if $.SignalControl.TransformEnabled }}
        - dash0transform/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
        {{- end }}
        - dash0resource
      exporters:
        - forward/logs-post-filter/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
        {{- if $.SignalControl.SignalToMetricsEnabled }}
        - dash0signaltometrics/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
        {{- end }}

    logs/post-filter/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}:
      receivers:
        - forward/logs-post-filter/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}
      {{- if or $.SignalControl.SpamFilterEnabled $.SignalControl.LogEnrichmentEnabled }}
      processors:
        {{- if $.SignalControl.SpamFilterEnabled }}
        - dash0metering/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}/post-filter
        {{- end }}
        {{- if $.SignalControl.LogEnrichmentEnabled }}
        - dash0logparser
        - dash0loggrouping
        {{- end }}
        {{- if $.SignalControl.SpamFilterEnabled }}
        - dash0filter/ns/{{ $ns }}/{{ $b.DatasetIndex }}/egress
        {{- end }}
      {{- end }}
      exporters:
        {{- if (or $.DevelopmentMode $.DebugVerbosityDetailed) }}
        - debug
        {{- end }}
        {{- range $exporter := $b.Exporters }}
        - {{ $exporter.Name }}
        {{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}

{{- if .InternalTelemetryEnabled }}

  telemetry:
    resource:
      attributes:
        {{- /*
        service.name (dash0-operator-collector), service.version (the collector distribution's version, see
        images/collector/src/builder/config.yaml) and service.instance.id (a random UUID) are provided automatically
        from the collector's build info, hence they are not listed here.
        */}}
        - name: service.namespace
          value: dash0-operator
        - name: k8s.cluster.uid
          value: "{{ .PseudoClusterUid }}"
        {{- if .ClusterName }}
        - name: k8s.cluster.name
          value: {{ yamlString .ClusterName }}
        {{- end }}
        - name: k8s.node.name
          value: ${env:K8S_NODE_NAME}
        - name: k8s.namespace.name
          value: ${env:DASH0_OPERATOR_NAMESPACE}
        - name: k8s.deployment.uid
          value: ${env:K8S_DEPLOYMENT_UID}
        - name: k8s.deployment.name
          value: ${env:K8S_DEPLOYMENT_NAME}
        - name: k8s.pod.uid
          value: ${env:K8S_POD_UID}
        - name: k8s.pod.name
          value: ${env:K8S_POD_NAME}
        - name: k8s.container.name
          value: "opentelemetry-collector"

{{- if .SelfMonitoringMetricsConfig }}
{{- .SelfMonitoringMetricsConfig }}
{{- end }}
{{- if .SelfMonitoringLogsConfig }}
{{- .SelfMonitoringLogsConfig }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
